          "id": "ai-news-2026-10-11-ar-EG-s011",
          "text": "كريم: أيوه، الإنترنت رجع.",
          "english": "Karim: Yes, the internet is back.",
          "kind": "teaching-example",
          "sourceIds": [],
          "transliteration": "Kareem: aywa, el-internet regeʿ."
        },
        {
          "id": "ai-news-2026-10-11-ar-EG-s012",
          "text": "منى: نجرب تاني؟",
          "english": "Mona: Shall we try again?",
          "kind": "teaching-example",
