          "id": "ai-news-2026-10-11-ar-EG-s013",
          "text": "كريم: أيوه، أنا جاهز.",
          "english": "Karim: Yes, I am ready.",
          "kind": "teaching-example",
          "sourceIds": [],
          "transliteration": "Kareem: aywa, ana gahez."
        },
        {
          "id": "ai-news-2026-10-11-ar-EG-s014",
          "text": "منى: الصفحة فتحت!",
          "english": "Mona: The page opened!",
          "kind": "teaching-example",
          "sourceIds": [],
          "transliteration": "Mona: es-safha fatahet!"
        },
        {
          "id": "ai-news-2026-10-11-ar-EG-s015",
          "text": "كريم: كويس، نكمل الشغل.",
          "english": "Karim: Good, let us continue the work.",
          "kind": "teaching-example",
          "sourceIds": [],
          "transliteration": "Kareem: kwayyes, nekammel esh-shoghl."
        }
      ]
